    "Initial/final observation errors and original Elapsed are combined after all applicable cleanup actions; Drop emits diagnostic and requests abort without claiming join.",
    "No mutex guard or watch borrow crosses the new awaits. Original four test entry bodies, sniffer positive and prior controls are preserved.",
    "Layout changes match previously retained formatter diagnostics; syntax/strict-check acceptance still requires root execution."
